## 🎨 ВИЗУАЛЬНЫЕ ПРОМТЫ

### Формула промта для картинок (Midjourney/DALL-E)

```
[Subject/Action] + [Environment/Background] + [Art Style/Lighting] 
+ [Mood/Atmosphere] + [Camera/Composition]
```

### Пример промта для картинки

```
A cute 3D Pixar-style illustration of a diverse group of kids wearing 
lab coats, mixing colorful glowing liquids in test tubes, science lab 
background with chalkboard formulas in English, bright cinematic lighting, 
vibrant colors, highly detailed, 8k, joyful and curious atmosphere --ar 16:9
```

### Пример промта для видео (Runway/Sora)

```
Slow motion, close up of a child's hands building a small wooden bridge 
from popsicle sticks, soft natural sunlight, educational and inspiring mood, 
shallow depth of field.
```

